PN,37201
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1787068094
OL,3,CGrenfell cladding firm paid
OL,4,Cshareholders '$31m more than victims
OL,5,Cand survivors'
OL,7,FA company that made the cladding used
OL,8,Fon Grenfell Tower paid more money to
OL,9,Fits shareholders than to the victims
OL,10,Fand survivors of the disaster,
OL,11,Faccording to a new investigation seen
OL,12,Fexclusively by ITV News London.
OL,14,FArconic manufactured the aluminium
OL,15,Fcomposite cladding fitted to the
OL,16,Ftower. The material was highly
OL,17,Fflammable and found to be a primary
OL,18,Fcause of the rapid spread of the
OL,19,Fdeadly fire.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1787068094
OL,3,CGrenfell cladding firm paid
OL,4,Cshareholders '$31m more than victims
OL,5,Cand survivors'
OL,7,FAccording to the report by think tank
OL,8,FCommon Wealth and financial
OL,9,Finvestigations organisation FIND.ngo,
OL,10,FArconic paid $74 million to its
OL,11,Fshareholders, compared with $43
OL,12,Fmillion in compensation to victims and
OL,13,Fsurvivors.
OL,15,FThat means $31 million more was paid
OL,16,Fto shareholders.
OL,18,FITV News London contacted Arconic for
OL,19,Fcomment but the company did not give a
OL,20,Fstatement.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1787068094
OL,3,CGrenfell cladding firm paid
OL,4,Cshareholders '$31m more than victims
OL,5,Cand survivors'
OL,7,FThe figures are revealed in a report
OL,8,Fwhich examined court documents and
OL,9,Ffinancial records relating to
OL,10,FArconic's conduct before and after the
OL,11,Ffire.
OL,13,FThe report claims Arconic was insured
OL,14,Ffor all but $2 million of its legal
OL,15,Fcosts, while UK taxpayers were left to
OL,16,Ffoot the bill for replacing dangerous
OL,17,Fcladding on buildings.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1787068094
OL,3,CGrenfell cladding firm paid
OL,4,Cshareholders '$31m more than victims
OL,5,Cand survivors'
OL,7,FIt also reveals that the particular
OL,8,Ftype of cladding used at Grenfell
OL,9,Faccounted for less than one per cent
OL,10,Fof Arconic's annual Reynobond PE sales
OL,11,Fat the time.
OL,13,FThe organisations say Arconic has not
OL,14,Fpublicly disclosed where the remaining
OL,15,F99 per cent of the product was used.
OL,17,FThey say the cladding had been sold
OL,18,Faround the world for at least 20 years
OL,19,Fbefore the Grenfell fire.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1787068094
OL,3,CGrenfell cladding firm paid
OL,4,Cshareholders '$31m more than victims
OL,5,Cand survivors'
OL,7,FEdward Daffarn is a Grenfell survivor
OL,8,Fand campaigner who lived on the 16th
OL,9,Ffloor and repeatedly warned about
OL,10,Fsafety problems at the tower before
OL,11,Fthe fire.
OL,13,F"What this report shows is the kind of
OL,14,Flike lack of corporate accountability
OL,15,Fand the way that our laws in the UK do
OL,16,Fnot hold those companies to account,"
OL,17,FEdward told ITV News London.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1787068094
OL,3,CGrenfell cladding firm paid
OL,4,Cshareholders '$31m more than victims
OL,5,Cand survivors'
OL,7,F"What is really shocking and really
OL,8,Fupsetting for people is that Arconic
OL,9,Fshareholders in the US were awarded
OL,10,F$74 million when they sued Arconic
OL,11,Fbecause of their behaviour around
OL,12,FGrenfell.
OL,14,F"And the Grenfell community, bereaved
OL,15,Fand survivors, received a payout of
OL,16,Falmost just half that from Arconic,
OL,17,Fwhich just seems completely unfair and
OL,18,Fdisrespectful.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1787068094
OL,3,CGrenfell cladding firm paid
OL,4,Cshareholders '$31m more than victims
OL,5,Cand survivors'
OL,7,F"There needs to be much more corporate
OL,8,Faccountability for companies," Edward
OL,9,Fexplained.
OL,11,FThe findings are based on detailed US
OL,12,Fand UK court documents, some of which
OL,13,Fhave only recently become publicly
OL,14,Favailable.
OL,16,FAlthough Arconic's settlements with
OL,17,Fvictims and survivors took place in
OL,18,F2023, the report also takes account of
OL,19,Fshareholder payments made as recently
OL,20,Fas March this year.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1787068094
OL,3,CGrenfell cladding firm paid
OL,4,Cshareholders '$31m more than victims
OL,5,Cand survivors'
OL,7,FCommon Wealth and FIND.ngo say the
OL,8,Fcase highlights wider concerns about
OL,9,Fcorporate accountability and whether
OL,10,Fcompanies can be held responsible when
OL,11,Ftheir products contribute to
OL,12,Fcatastrophic failures.
OL,14,FThey say the UK lags behind other
OL,15,Fcountries in holding corporations to
OL,16,Faccount.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1787068094
OL,3,CGrenfell cladding firm paid
OL,4,Cshareholders '$31m more than victims
OL,5,Cand survivors'
OL,7,FThe report warns that unless the
OL,8,Fsystem changes, the factors that
OL,9,Fcontributed to the Grenfell tragedy
OL,10,Fcould allow similar corporate
OL,11,Fmisconduct to go unpunished in future.
OL,13,FLeela Jadhav, lead researcher at
OL,14,FCommon Wealth said she had spoken to
OL,15,FGrenfell United, a group representing
OL,16,Fsurvivors and bereaved, throughout the
OL,17,Fproject.
OL,19,F"They are understandably angry," Leela
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1787068094
OL,3,CGrenfell cladding firm paid
OL,4,Cshareholders '$31m more than victims
OL,5,Cand survivors'
OL,7,F"There is also a sense that this is
OL,8,Fjust to be expected - it's simply
OL,9,Fbusiness as usual.
OL,11,F"Companies don't seem to care about
OL,12,Fthe impact of their conduct on
OL,13,Fordinary people.
OL,15,F"They care much more about their
OL,16,Fshareholders and profits.
OL,18,F"And that is a growing trend worldwide
OL,19,Fwhich needs to be addressed and which
OL,20,Four project hopes to address," she
OL,21,Fadded.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G10/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1787068094
OL,3,CGrenfell cladding firm paid
OL,4,Cshareholders '$31m more than victims
OL,5,Cand survivors'
OL,7,F72 people died in the Grenfell Tower
OL,8,Ffire in June 2017.
OL,10,FCladding, specifically its
OL,11,Fpolyethylene core, was found to be the
OL,12,Fmain reason the fire spread so rapidly
OL,13,Fup, down and around the building.
OL,15,FThe polyethylene burned intensely,
OL,16,Fmelted and dripped, creating new fires
OL,17,Flower down the tower.
OL,19,FThe Ministry of Housing has been
OL,20,Fapproached for comment.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G11/12
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
